                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Here is a [url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cXbZJ8bSwrM]video of my playthrough of this game[/url]. \n\nYou have some explosions in the background, a baseball bat, and a Donald Trump piñata hanging from a tree, all while \"Jarabe Tapatio\" plays (you'll recognize it when you hear it). Whenever you hit the piñata you get a Donald Trump sound bite. Body parts eventually fall off until all you're left with is the head, and when you knock that down, the game is over and a replay button appears. That's all there is to it. The physics are bad and don't match well with your hits and you'll hear the same sound bites repeat frequently. There is no sort of scoring system or any motivation to play through it a second time. No matter how much you may hate Donald Trump, there is no catharsis to be had here.\n\nEven at 99 cents, the game is just too basic to be worth it.",
